# Toolchain installed by docs/operator-quickstart.md §2.
#
# The quickstart tells you to copy a scratch node_modules into kotoba/ and to
# run `npm install` inside appview/maps-tile-server-t1l3srv0/. Without this
# file a later `git add -A` stages those trees, which inflates the tracked
# file count and makes docs/verify-custody.cljs report a false divergence.
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.svelte-kit/
build/
dist/
.vite/
test-results/
